From 1cadb0ad329812e4b3551dc1684dc0cb6b89d9d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaptainCucumber <37813159+CaptainCucumber@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:57:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve Admin frame semantics in protocol v3

Keep existing network-frame stamps for the Admin adapter while using the save-persistent game tick for local single-player dispatch.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

